TRACKS X 0 DO 8571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL1 ;
TRACKS Y 0 DO 8571 STEP 1400 LAYER METAL1 ;

COMPONENTS 2 ;
- I_0_0 Modulation + PLACED ( 220500 2100000 ) N ;
- I_1_0 VMMWTA + PLACED ( 1620500 0 ) N ;
END COMPONENTS

